den="true">☾</span></button><button class="menu-toggle" type="button" data-menu-toggle aria-controls="primary-navigation" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Open menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button></div></nav></header><main id="conteudo"><section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-inner"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="signal" aria-hidden="true"></span>Guided intelligent ERP · Local-first</p><h1>Run the business with context, not an endless spreadsheet.</h1><p class="hero-lead">Customers, sales, work orders, inventory, purchasing, cash flow, documents and guided assistance in one Android experience for small businesses.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/en/features">Explore features</a><a class="button secondary" href="/en/how-it-works">See how it works</a></div><p class="release-note">Preparing for closed testing on Google Play.</p></div><div class="guided-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="visual-axis"></div><div class="brand-orbit"><img src="/assets/illustration-workflow.svg" width="240" height="180" alt="" fetchpriority="high"></div><ol class="guided-nodes"><li class="node-capture"><span>01</span>Capture</li><li class="node-understand"><span>02</span>Understand</li><li class="node-confirm"><span>03</span>Confirm</li><li class="node-register"><span>04</span>Register</li><li class="node-follow"><span>05</span>Follow up</li></ol></div></div></section><section class="section problem-section"><div class="wrap split-intro"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Less friction in management</p><h2>An ERP that helps work move forward.</h2></div><div class="section-copy"><p>Rumman connects information that is often split between messages, documents, spreadsheets and the bank.</p><p>It organizes daily operations around context and keeps human confirmation in every important action.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/how-it-works">Understand the guided cycle <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section home-feature-overview"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">One connected operation</p><h2>From the first contact to financial follow-up.</h2><p class="lead">Modules share context to reduce duplicate work and make the next step easier to understand.</p></div><div class="overview-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Customers and operations</h3><p>Profiles, proposals, work orders and history on the same path.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Inventory and purchasing</h3><p>Physical stock, reservations, availability, suppliers and replenishment.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Finance</h3><p>Income, expenses, categories, periods and exports.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Documents and assistant</h3><p>Documents, OCR, text, voice and attachments reviewed by the user.</p></article></div><a class="button secondary section-action" href="/en/features">View all features</a></div></section><section class="section privacy-section"><div class="wrap privacy-grid"><div class="privacy-mark" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/illustration-privacy.svg" width="240" height="180" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="privacy-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy by design</p><h2>Your work data stays under your control.</h2><p>Customers, detailed records, conversations, photos and documents stay primarily in the app private storage.</p><p>Rumman does not sell data and does not display ads.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/privacy">Read the Privacy Policy <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section blog-preview"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Content for small businesses</p><h2>Organization begins before the software.</h2><p class="lead">Straightforward guides for cash flow, inventory, operations and data care.</p></div><div class="blog-grid"><article class="blog-card"><a class="blog-card-visual" href="/en/blog/como-fazer-fluxo-de-caixa-pequena-empresa" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="/assets/blog-cashflow.svg" width="240" height="180" alt="" loading="lazy"></a><div><p class="blog-meta">Cash flow for a small business · 6 min</p><h3><a href="/en/blog/como-fazer-fluxo-de-caixa-pequena-empresa">Cash flow for a small business: a practical routine</a></h3><p>A simple routine to record income and expenses, understand the balance and make safer decisions.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/blog/como-fazer-fluxo-de-caixa-pequena-empresa">Read article <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="blog-card"><a class="blog-card-visual" href="/en/blog/controle-de-estoque-para-pequenas-empresas" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="/assets/blog-inventory.svg" width="240" height="180" alt="" loading="lazy"></a><div><p class="blog-meta">Inventory control for small businesses · 6 min</p><h3><a href="/en/blog/controle-de-estoque-para-pequenas-empresas">Inventory control for small businesses: where to start</a></h3><p>Understand physical stock, reserved quantities, availability and minimum stock to purchase better and avoid promises your inventory cannot meet.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/blog/controle-de-estoque-para-pequenas-empresas">Read article <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article><article class="blog-card"><a class="blog-card-visual" href="/en/blog/erp-para-empresa-de-servicos" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img src="/assets/blog-service-erp.svg" width="240" height="180" alt="" loading="lazy"></a><div><p class="blog-meta">Work orders · 6 min</p><h3><a href="/en/blog/erp-para-empresa-de-servicos">Work orders: how to make service delivery easier to follow</a></h3><p>A clear work-order routine connects request, scope, execution, materials, approval and history.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/blog/erp-para-empresa-de-servicos">Read article <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article></div><a class="button secondary section-action" href="/en/blog/">Visit the blog</a></div></section><section class="final-cta"><div class="wrap final-cta-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">Rumman · Guided Intelligent ERP</p><h2>Clearer management for work with less friction.</h2><p>Organize customers, cash flow, documents and everyday decisions in a guided Android experience.</p></div><a class="button primary" href="/en/features">Discover features</a></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="wrap footer-main"><div class="footer-brand-block"><a class="brand footer-brand" href="/en/"><span class="brand-icon"><img src="/assets/rumman-brand-mark-original.png" width="680" height="680" alt=""></span><span class="brand-name">Rumman</span></a><p>Guided intelligent Android ERP for small businesses.</p></div><div class="footer-links"><strong>Product</strong><a href="/en/features">Features</a><a href="/en/how-it-works">How it works</a><a href="/en/plans">Plans</a><a href="/en/faq">FAQ</a></div><div class="footer-links"><strong>Content</strong><a href="/en/blog/">Blog</a><a href="/en/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/excluir-conta">Delete account</a><a href="mailto:e-mail@rumman.app.br">Support</a></div><div class="footer-links"><strong>Development</strong><a href="mailto:devs@pascoal.eti.br">Technical contact</a></div></div><div class="wrap footer-bottom"><span>© 2026 Rumman</span><nav class="language-switcher footer-language" aria-label="Language"><span class="visually-hidden">Language</span><a href="/" lang="pt-BR">PT</a><a href="/en/" lang="en" aria-current="page">EN</a><a href="/es/" lang="es">ES</a><a href="/fr/" lang="fr">FR</a></nav><span>Built by <a href="https://pascoal.eti.br" rel="external noopener">pascoal.eti.br</a></span></div></footer><script src="/assets/site.js?v=20260722-6" defer></script></body></html>